{
  "outcome": "pending_approval",
  "reply_to_user": "Hi Tom, we found Harborview Supplies' invoice #4471 (October pallets). Our spam filter held it in quarantine, so it never reached your inbox. We've requested that it be released to your mailbox, and a technician needs to approve that before it is delivered. Once approved, it should appear in your Inbox. We'll let you know when it's done. Also, our records show your account is currently locked after several failed sign-in attempts. If you are unable to sign in, please reply and let us know so we can help with that as well.",
  "internal_note": "Checked lookup_user: account status locked, failed_login_count 5, sign_in_blocked false, mailbox 22.7% used, device BL-LT-0104. Checked quarantine: Q-1004 from billing@harborview-supplies.example, subject 'Invoice #4471 - October pallets', reason spam, releasable true. Q-1005 is malware and was not touched. Release of Q-1004 queued as approval_id 1 for technician sign-off; it has not run. The account lockout is not in the ticket; it needs a separate unlock_account decision if the user is unable to sign in. Recommend the technician verify the vendor sender is legitimate before approving. KB-012 was relevant to the quarantine check; KB-007 covers the release process.",
